      "message": "We shouldn\u0027t static cast a C-style string to std::string, we would just use the append operators on `toPipelineLabel()` that returns an `SkString`.\n\nThat said, this adds string allocation overhead to every trace, which I\u0027d like to minimize so it doesn\u0027t bias the CPU time measurements.  We can perform this concatenation inside `GraphicsPipeline::PipelineInfo` if we update its constructor to take in the RenderPassDesc (which is available, we just didn\u0027t do it).",
